        <div class="analysis-col">
            <p>By region, the businesses with no website listed at all were <strong>25.4% in the US, 15.6% in the Gulf and 10.5% in the UK</strong>. The American figure is the one that surprised us most, and it is the single largest opportunity in the dataset: you cannot improve a website that does not exist.</p>
        </div>
